cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite our work."
type: software
title: "GT-Free OCR Metrics: Reference-Free OCR Evaluation via Render-and-Compare"
version: "1.0.0"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  A framework for evaluating OCR systems without ground-truth text.
  The pipeline renders OCR output back to images and measures visual
  similarity against masked originals, using a suite of 109+ methods
  spanning pixel-level, perceptual, and learned similarity metrics.
  Validated on OmniDocBench (1355 pages, EN/ZH).
references:
  - type: dataset
    title: "OmniDocBench: Benchmarking Document Parsing with Diverse Layouts"
    authors:
      - family-names: Hu
        given-names: Linke
    year: 2024
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.07626"
